## Build order

1. Locations: Nigeria, 36 states + FCT, LGAs, cities/areas and location queries.
2. Authentication: register/login, access/refresh tokens, cookie + Bearer support, req.user.id and role middleware.
3. Seller onboarding: seller profile, business locations and fulfilment locations.
4. Catalog: categories, brands, products, variants and media.
5. Inventory: location-specific inventory, stock movements and reservation logic.
6. Marketplace: search, buyer discovery, cart, checkout, orders, seller orders and fulfilment.
7. 1688-style sourcing: sourcing requests, supplier responses, negotiation, counter offers and accepted quote → order.
8. Behavior/event system: searches, views, carts, purchases, stockouts, sourcing activity and acquisition attribution.
9. Analytics: demand, supply, conversion, geographic activity and seller performance.
10. AI intelligence: market opportunities, unmet demand, seller recommendations, inventory opportunities and buyer intelligence.
11. Financing-readiness layer: Business Growth Profile, evidence-based metrics, consent and financial-institution view.

